    {
      "id": "claim_9515e7fabafe4b98a774f3542fff3d8e",
      "statement": "Gateway commands are limited to /start, /status, /task <beschrijving>, /cancel <task_id>: /task forwards the prompt with the bot config's machineId to ops.createTask binding the task to that machine, /cancel without a wired cancelTask op surfaces TASK_CANCELLATION_UNAVAILABLE, and Telegram 409 getUpdates conflicts (another consumer of the same token) are handled in both bot.catch and the bot.start() rejection as warnings without crashing the process.",
