      "statement": "Webhook commands split into read-only SQLite summaries (/status, /loops, /agents, /mission, /dennis — loop start/stop is deliberately not exposed) and mutations routed through an injected TelegramApiService (/task creates a pending local task on machine 'telegram-webhook', /cancel hits the task cancel route, /approve and /reject hit approval routes with SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN translated to a refusal, /dennis_task permission-checks create:task and creates a dry_run-only task pinned to dennis-agent); with no api injected every mutation answers TELEGRAM_API_UNAVAILABLE.",
