      "statement": "All outbound delivery (sendMessage and the broadcastAlert/requestApproval fan-out to allowed users) posts MarkdownV2-escaped text to api.telegram.org/bot<token>/sendMessage with a 15-second timeout, and every failure — including non-2xx Telegram rejections — is collapsed to TELEGRAM_DELIVERY_FAILED because the request URL embeds the bot credential and raw fetch errors must never reach logs or callers.",
