    {
      "id": "claim_5af3e125d8ef4a83967e82f0e7d034eb",
      "statement": "TelegramApiService is an authenticated API client rather than a task/approval writer: its constructor throws TELEGRAM_API_MUST_BE_LOCAL unless the base URL is http on 127.0.0.1/localhost/[::1] without embedded credentials so mapped-user Bearer tokens can never be forwarded remotely, requireActor resolves actors by id or email, rejects disabled accounts (AUTH_DISABLED_OR_UNLINKED) and enforces RBAC (FORBIDDEN), and each request mints a fresh JWT for that actor with redirect:'error' and a 15-second timeout, surfacing the server's error code on non-2xx.",
